    "System-memory bytes are 32-byte L2 system-memory fill/write sector proxies on Orin UMA, not complete EMC byte counts; they exclude L2 hits and profiler replay backup traffic.",
    "Raw bank-conflict counters and the NCU excessive-wavefront rule use different denominators and are not divided into one another.",
    "smsp inst_executed_op_ldgsts and sm sass_inst_executed_op_ldgsts_cache subtypes are different counter domains; subtype sums are not subtracted from the total.",
    "Memory-table report durations are not mixed with matched-core durations. The memory metric set produced a 1.552232x native-to-inclusive-bridge ratio versus 1.568198x for the core set.",
    "NCU controlled no clocks and emitted its standard unmodified-clock warning. The target independently reported fixed 1.3005 GHz GPU and 3.2 GHz EMC clocks; durations remain diagnostic because replay itself perturbs cache, memory, and temperature state.",
    "The cuBLASLt symbol and exact three-stage-sized shared allocation strongly support a K64 three-operand-stage interpretation, but the vendor-private symbol is not a stable ABI and does not prove exact prefetch distance."
